   "items": [
    {
     "q": "꼭 절해야 돼요?",
     "qen": "Do I have to bow?",
     "qaudio": "audio/qt1.mp3",
     "a": "아니요. 종교 때문에 어려우면 묵념만 해도 돼요.",
     "aen": "No. If bowing is hard for religious reasons, a silent prayer is fine.",
     "why": "Many Christian families lay a flower and pray in silence instead of bowing.",
